    rdfs:label "JTBD-002 ABC Transverse Sales Revenue Gate  ## Job When 02 ABC OS & Child Care BOS prepares any proposal, quote, commitment, sales script, close motion, or revenue handoff, Sales must verify qualification and cross-domain readiness.  ## Output A dated Sales readiness decision: - SALES_READY - NEEDS_QUALIFICATION - BLOCKED_COMMITMENT  ## Readiness Checks | Check | Question | | --- | --- | | Diagnostic | What pain/fit evidence exists? | | Authority | Who can decide? | | Scope | What is included/excluded? | | Price | What is quoted and approved? | | Delivery | Can Product/Ops deliver? | | Legal | Are claims/terms safe? | | Handoff | Who owns next step? |  ## Guardrail No childcare-facing proposal may be sent without trust proof, service scope, staffing feasibility, compliance-adjacent review, and payment boundary.  ## Proof Attach Sales packet, proposal, cross-domain approvals, and final Sales decision." ;
