    rdfs:label "ABC Sales Transverse Revenue Handoff OS  ## Purpose Sales is the transverse revenue handoff gate for 02 ABC OS & Child Care BOS. It converts qualified demand into bounded proposals, commitments, and handoffs without breaking Growth, Product, Ops, IT, Finance, People, or Legal constraints.  ## Operating Thesis ABC needs Sales to qualify family/client needs with trust, compliance awareness, staffing reality, and service clarity.  ## Eight-Domain Sales Interface | Domain | Sales Surface | Required Proof | | --- | --- | --- |" ;
